# Kata Step By Step — Content Bundle

This repository hosts the content manifest and update bundles for the 
[Kata Step By Step](https://katastepbystep.com) mobile app.

## Files

- `app_manifest.json` — version manifest checked by the app on startup
- `kata.json` — kata records (150 kata across 10 styles)
- `styles.json` — karate style definitions
- `masters.json` — karate master profiles
- `glossary.json` — technique terminology
- `history.json` — karate history articles
- `reference.json` — reference content
- `downloads.json` — downloadable resources

## About

The app checks this manifest periodically to detect content updates.
When a new version is available, users are prompted to download the 
updated bundle within the app.

This content is maintained by Mark Loftus at katastepbystep.com.
